<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Kiwi plans public float by early April 1997.</title>
<headline>NZ's Kiwi plans public float by early April 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kiwi International Airlines chief executive Ewan Wilson said on Friday that the company's planned public flotation would now take place early in April 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;The public float will be early in April of next year,&quot; Wilson told journalists at a briefing.</p>
<p>The company earlier announced it would shed 90 staff in a restructuring move aimed to combat financial losses.</p>
